#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-errors-and-files.md:60
msgid "A **syntax error**: the code is not valid Python. Nothing runs - Python checks the whole file first (session 1)."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-errors-and-files.md:62
msgid "An **exception**: the code is valid, but something goes wrong **while it runs**: a text that is not a number, a missing file, a missing key. The script stops at that line - unless the exception is **caught**."
msgstr ""

